<div class="post">
<h2>September 14, 2005</h2>


<h1 id="a000016">Latest Position - New Feature!</h1>

<p>The 'Latest Position' link on the horizontal navigation bar is finally operational.   Previously when anybody clicked on the link it brought up one of those disappointing 'coming soon' messages.   Now it brings up a map of the world, which I, of course, intend to update as we travel.  Have a look...</p>

