<h2>August 15, 2005</h2>


<h1 id="a000007">The Plan</h1>

<p>My plans are purposefully vague at this point, not because of some hidden agenda, but more because I'm trying to leave myself free to take up whatever opportunity strikes along the way.  It's not about setting  an itinerary and pre-arranging rides, it's more about walking out of my front door on October 1st with one objective; To return home the long way.  To finish with a complete and real sense of the true scale of this planet.  Of course, I plan to have some fun along the way and maybe even see some sights.</p>



